# Marketing art is generated and iterated on locally, and a single thumbnail is
# ~2 MB. The fourteen already committed here stay tracked; this stops new ones
# being swept in by `git add -A`, which is how 7.9 MB reached a pull request
# about link previews.
assets/marketing/
